## Why This Is Asked

Tests integration of multimodal signals into ICA, a practical scenario in automotive settings where visual cues help resolve source ambiguity and nonstationary noise.

## Key Concepts

- Multimodal ICA with audio-visual priors
- Online whitening and natural-gradient demixing
- Cross-bin permutation tracking using AV alignment cues
- Latency constraints for real-time automotive use
- Evaluation including SDR, SIR, and lip-sync accuracy

## Code Example

```javascript
// Pseudo-code sketch for AV-regularized online ICA
let W = initialize(6,6);
for each frame t:
  X_t = frameAudio(mics, 32, 0.5);
  V_t = extractVisualFeatures(video);
  X_whitened = onlineWhiten(X_t);
  Y_t = W * X_whitened;
  W = naturalGradientUpdate(W, Y_t, V_t);
  permute = trackPermutationAV(Y_t, V_t);
  output = applyPermutation(Y_t, permute);
```

## Why This Is Asked
Tests a beginner-friendly yet concrete application of ICA outside audio signals, emphasizing practical steps like patching, whitening, and cross-patch alignment.

## Key Concepts
- Patch-based ICA on images
- Whitening followed by a 2×3 demixer for 2 sources
- Cross-patch permutation/sign alignment
- Reconstruction and basic image quality metrics

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudo-code sketch for patch-wise ICA workflow
function separateTextures(image) {
  const patches = extractPatches(image);
  const sources = patches.map(p => ICA2x3(p));
  const aligned = alignAcrossPatches(sources);
  return reconstructImage(aligned);
}
```

